# Auto Trading: Quick Buy ＆ Take-Profit / Stop-Loss

GMGN Auto Trading helps you quickly buy at market price, and presetting take-profit and stop-loss is ideal for rapidly fluctuating market conditions, like sniping new tokens.

Supported Chain: Solana

## **1. Automated Trading - GMGN Web Version**

1\) **Experience Auto Trading by Logging in via Telegram**: In the trading section, select "Auto" and click "Connect Telegram" or the "Connect" button in the upper right corner. You will be automatically redirected to the GMGN login bot. Click "Log In", then click "Open" link to complete the TG login.&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FN5w0nmSLzbF5LZ5bbU6q%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=9fbaa8ee-c938-4a5f-a02f-7231128e0ddd" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

Open the GMGN login bot and click "Login" and "Open"

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2Fizg63opnK3OaXNWENTce%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=67a85281-f1b2-45a7-90de-be784781813d" alt="" width="563"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

2）**Set Auto Trading Parameters:** After successful login, Click "Set" to configure the parameters of your Auto Trading strategy.&#x20;

* Set the amount and take-profit or stop-loss values (at least one value must be filled in).
* The settings for slippage, priority fee, MEV, remain consistent with the buy/sell settings. Changes made on the Auto Trading settings page will update the buy/sell values as well. Similarly, if the parameters for buy/sell are adjusted, automated trading will also place orders according to the modified values.&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FhqOM8xRYfLhDMG3OpifH%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=55f04d03-57ad-4b4c-aad0-3548d3eda7b2" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2F2iMVVzoDtC3d6SxbLFRe%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=934747bb-b201-4fc3-8202-d1a7e07e55e9" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

3\) **Create and Run Auto Trading Orders:**

* After saving the automated strategy parameters, click "Buy XXX SOL" on the trading page to create an automated trading order.
* The created automated trading orders can be viewed in the "<mark style="color:red;">Strategy Order</mark>" list.&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FQMEagjqmYcRjZKhfo9Q2%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=0f8d9f46-54a4-460a-bcd3-28c0d75b4a40" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2Fu7p0Tf2xCTIoL1NuOLqB%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=6518752e-cf70-428e-a885-45fe5172969f" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

## **2. How to Enable Trailing Take Profit**  <a href="#ru-he-kai-qi-zhui-zong-zhi-ying" id="ru-he-kai-qi-zhui-zong-zhi-ying"></a>

Open the trading panel, select \[Auto], you need to set:&#x20;

1. Buy amount and take profit ratio;&#x20;
2. Enable Trailing Take Profit (once enabled, it will show the minimum profit: assuming the worst-case where the price immediately drops after hit the take-profit ratio);&#x20;
3. Set the drawback percentage (the order will close immediately when the percentage drop from the highest price exceeds the drawback percentage).&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FaFwZOaXb2cd88H5xh8zb%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=578247d4-a0cd-4e43-9ec8-dcd7a28916c6" alt="" width="375"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

After enabling Trailing Take Profit, Auto trading panel will change to **TTP**. When you click to buy XX SOL, the system will immediately buy the token and execute the order according to the parameters you set.&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FjlgnYMOCE7Fo0ptnF7AM%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=91283ff7-429d-43b0-9657-baeec1483143" alt="" width="375"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

**Viewing Trailing Stop Orders**&#x20;

You can view the order information in \[Auto Orders] list.&#x20;

* When the Trailing Take Profit has not been triggered, the status is a **gray dot**. Hover will display: Trailing Take Profit is pending, and show the trigger price. Trigger price = buy price \* (1 + TP ratio%)&#x20;
* After TTP is triggered, the status changes to a **green dot**. Hover will display: Trailing Stop activated, and the highest price reached, and the current stop-profit price.&#x20;

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FdPsHAq8IL3aK3aMiIW5J%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=2129d1e4-de5c-4968-8cc7-9fce2cd50e88" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FXVwTJAVgMZginlLLcJUf%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=c1af1818-1494-4f54-8d08-dd6eb70edd1b" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

### **3. How to Enable Trailing Stop Loss**  <a href="#how-to-enable-trailing-stop-loss" id="how-to-enable-trailing-stop-loss"></a>

In the Auto trading settings page, set stop-loss ratio and then enable trailing stop-loss.

<figure><img src="https://3168316658-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FcwvUtvEIyqrWZx7sPliY%2Fuploads%2FJOg0xni3Buqa1BPqUe5F%2Fimage.png?alt=media&amp;token=e4744695-112d-43f4-9a06-d876440a88dd" alt="" width="563"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

